{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e1681908-7efe-838b-b785-547db01ef53d",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T09:32:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peggy Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, I'm calling about a streetlight that's out. It's been dark since last Thursday, which is a long time for a light to be out on a street people actually walk down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:31:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, last Thursday. Let me grab that down. Where's the light located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:31:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of my house, 467 Marsh Street, in the Point. I'm the landlord there, so I notice when the tenants complain, and they have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "467 Marsh Street. Got it. Is the light completely out, or does it flicker on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Completely out. It's not flickering, it's just dead. Honestly flickering would be an improvement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:31:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Do you know if there's a number on the pole? Usually a little tag, maybe at eye level."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look, I'm not out there right now. Actually I don't remember seeing one. It's the pole right at the front of the property, by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:32:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works, we can find it from the address. Anything else about it? Any damage to the pole, wires hanging, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:32:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, the pole looks fine. I'd just like a crew to come check it. One of my coworkers always honks twice when pulling in to pick me up, and she said she nearly missed the driveway in the dark. So it's kind of a hassle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:32:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So that's a light out since last Thursday in front of 467 Marsh, pole looks undamaged, and you want a crew to check it. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:32:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, I've got that. I'll put in the request and a crew will take a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:32:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks Kevin. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good one."
    }
  ],
